    "summary": "This course introduces fundamental molecular biology concepts to first-year engineering students, exploring cellular organization, the flow of genetic information from DNA to protein, and computational approaches in bioinformatics. Evaluation is determined by a multiple-choice midterm exam worth 40% and a comprehensive multiple-choice final exam worth 60%."
